# Catalog data

This note explains how the catalog files may be used. It records
attribution. It is not legal advice.

The files are:

- `Skyrim Wiki/Data/wiki_database.json` — German source catalog
- `Skyrim Wiki/Data/wiki_database.en.json` — English overlay

Where the English overlay has no text for a field, the application
shows the German source.

