## Game facts

Names, statistics, FormIDs, locations, quest structure, and similar
facts describe The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim Special Edition, including
Dawnguard, Hearthfire, and Dragonborn. They are recorded here so the
reference can be used offline. They are not owned by this project.

